log.unconfirmed = The tracking log does not confirm the found messages ({0}). Examine them before a delete.
sum.unconfirmed = NOT CONFIRMED BY THE TRACKING LOG — examine the messages before a delete.
confirm.unconfirmed = WARNING: the tracking log did not find these messages. The search found them only with the KQL query. Make sure that these are the correct messages.

