status.detail = Loading the recipients of the message...
note.partial = Other recipients: select the message
note.partialGroup = Message to a group, about {0} recipients: select the message to load them
note.partialToGroup = Message to a group: select the message to load the recipients
trsum.partial = Recipient {0}:
dlg.exportPartial = The data is complete for {0} of {1} messages. Load the data of all messages before the export? This can take some minutes. No: export the data as it is.

